</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thy saving pow’r Thou still dost show;</l><l>Thou still dost speak, enlighten, guide;</l><l>Thou and the Spirit in one stream</l><l>Sweep many in Thy living tide.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Through Him Thy power’s not withheld;</l><l>Through Him Thy working does not cease;</l><l>Thou still dost comfort and command,</l><l>Encourage, strengthen, and release.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Since Thou art with the Spirit one</l><l>His coming means that Thou hast come,</l><l>And His indwelling is Thine own,</l><l>Since Thou the Spirit hast become.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He executes within my heart</l><l>All Thy desires and Thy demands,</l><l>As for the Father here on earth</l><l>Thou hast performed all His commands.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>By knowing Him we know Thyself;</l><l>Obeying Him we Thee obey;</l><l>Allowing Him ourselves to fill,</l><l>We’re filled with Thee, O wondrous way!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Thou art not far away in heav’n,</l><l>Leaving us here alone, apart;</l><l>But Thou art still on earth; how grand!</l><l>Thou livest right within my heart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
